  m_text: "Ders kitab\u0131na g\xF6re Os lacrimale, y\xFCz kemiklerinin en k\xFC\xE7\xFCk
    ve en ince olan\u0131d\u0131r. Orbita\u2019n\u0131n i\xE7 yan duvar\u0131n\u0131n
